    dcterms:description "Manufacturers, authorised representatives, importers and distributors shall, further to a reasoned request from a competent national authority, provide it, in electronic form, with all the information and documentation necessary to demonstrate the conformity of the EU fertilising product with this Regulation in a language which can be easily understood by that authority."@en ;
    dcterms:relation <http://example.org/ie-solution/icscms> .

